@startuml CU-24
actor "Cajero / Encargado de sucursal" as Csh
boundary "«UI» Angular (POS)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /payments, /sales" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» PaymentService / ReceiptService / Sale / Payment / Receipt" as Model

Csh -> UI : 1: confirmar cobro en caja
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /payments/confirm
Ctrl -> Model : 3: payment_service.confirm(db)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: PaymentRead (COMPLETED) + ReceiptRead
Ctrl --> UI : 5: pago confirmado y comprobante
UI --> Csh : 6: cobro completado

Csh -> UI : 7: consultar/descargar comprobante
UI -> Ctrl : 8: GET /sales/{id}/receipt
Ctrl -> Model : 9: receipt_service.get_for_sale(db, sale)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: ReceiptRead (document_url)
Ctrl --> UI : 11: ReceiptRead
UI --> Csh : 12: comprobante mostrado/descargado

@enduml